# Keep the build context small and the build reproducible.
#
# `node_modules` is the one that matters: hundreds of MB shipped to the daemon
# on every build, and worse, a host-built tree can carry native binaries for
# the wrong platform. The image runs its own `npm ci` from the lockfile.
node_modules
dist
.vite

# Local-only
.env
.env.*
*.log

# Never part of a build
.git
.gitignore
PROGRESS.md
